    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1249077 of that facility ended on 2024-09-11 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2024-11-15.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vasopressin is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": []
